ious episodes of CSI where it was used as their &amp;quot;subculture of the week.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m not really into BDSM (except in a very peripheral way), but my friend is and she liked the idea of L\u2019Desir Acharne when I showed it to her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-07T08:05:41-07:00","id":1406780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1406563-just-read-cult-of-ecstasy-revised?p=1406754#post1406754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In something tangentially related , Marquis de Sade was a garbage person that used his power as a minor nobleman to abuse Women and children.<br /> <br /> I have no idea why certain Left wing thinkers like this guy. <a href=\"https://www.datalounge.com/thread/14619243-marquis-de-sade-rebel-pervert-rapist...hero-\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.datalounge.com/thread/14...rapist...hero-</a></div> </div> </div> </div>He talks about cutting off and frying women\u2019s breasts!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"20